cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "saemMicrobiome: SAEM Models for Longitudinal Microbiome Data"
abstract: >-
  Implementation of zero-inflated beta regression (ZIBR) and zero-inflated
  beta-binomial mixed regression (ZIBBMR) models for longitudinal microbiome
  data, estimated with the SAEM (Stochastic Approximation EM) algorithm.
type: software
version: 0.0.1
date-released: "2026-08-24"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/cmezabec/saemMicrobiome"
keywords:
  - microbiome
  - longitudinal data
  - mixed-effects models
  - SAEM algorithm
  - zero-inflated models
  - R
